{"seq":2,"slug":"gateway-observability","title":"网关可观测性：追踪、指标与告警","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/graphql-federation/operations/gateway-observability","wordCount":592,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"网关可观测性-追踪-指标与告警\">网关可观测性：追踪、指标与告警</h1><p>Federation 网关是整个 supergraph 的流量咽喉——每一个客户端请求都经由它分发到子图。当系统延迟飙升或错误率上升时，完善的可观测性体系能在分钟级定位具体瓶颈。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>可观测性三支柱在 Federation 中的应用：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>支柱</th>\n<th>Federation 场景</th>\n<th>关键数据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>分布式追踪</strong></td>\n<td>查询横跨 Router + 多子图</td>\n<td>每个 fetch span 延迟、错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>指标</strong></td>\n<td>聚合性能与健康视图</td>\n<td>QPS、P99、错误率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>日志</strong></td>\n<td>单次请求调试</td>\n<td>查询计划、子图响应、错误详情</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Client --&gt; Router&#10;    Router --&gt;|span| OTEL[OTel Collector]&#10;    Router --&gt;|fetch span| S1[子图 A]&#10;    Router --&gt;|fetch span| S2[子图 B]&#10;    OTEL --&gt; Jaeger[Jaeger / Tempo]&#10;    OTEL --&gt; Prom[Prometheus]&#10;    Prom --&gt; Grafana\">graph TD\n    Client --&gt; Router\n    Router --&gt;|span| OTEL[OTel Collector]\n    Router --&gt;|fetch span| S1[子图 A]\n    Router --&gt;|fetch span| S2[子图 B]\n    OTEL --&gt; Jaeger[Jaeger / Tempo]\n    OTEL --&gt; Prom[Prometheus]\n    Prom --&gt; Grafana</pre><h2 id=\"apollo-router-遥测配置\">Apollo Router 遥测配置</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"telemetry:&#10;  instrumentation:&#10;    spans:&#10;      router:&#10;        attributes:&#10;          http.request.method: true&#10;      subgraph:&#10;        attributes:&#10;          subgraph.name: true&#10;  exporters:&#10;    tracing:&#10;      otlp:&#10;        endpoint: http://otel-collector:4317&#10;    metrics:&#10;      prometheus:&#10;        enabled: true&#10;        listen: 0.0.0.0:9090\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">telemetry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  instrumentation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    spans</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      router</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        attributes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          http.request.method</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      subgraph</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        attributes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          subgraph.name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  exporters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    tracing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      otlp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">http://otel-collector:4317</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    metrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      prometheus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        enabled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        listen</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">0.0.0.0:9090</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"分布式追踪结构\">分布式追踪结构</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"[router] POST /graphql (150ms)&#10;  ├── [supergraph] query_planning (5ms)&#10;  ├── [subgraph:users] fetch (45ms)&#10;  ├── [subgraph:orders] fetch (80ms) ← 瓶颈&#10;  └── [supergraph] response_formatting (3ms)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[router] POST /graphql (150ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ├── [supergraph] query_planning (5ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ├── [subgraph:users] fetch (45ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ├── [subgraph:orders] fetch (80ms) ← 瓶颈</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  └── [supergraph] response_formatting (3ms)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键 span 告警阈值：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Span</th>\n<th>告警建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>router</code> 总延迟</td>\n<td>P99 &gt; 500ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>query_planning</code></td>\n<td>&gt; 50ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>subgraph.fetch</code></td>\n<td>P99 &gt; 200ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>subgraph.fetch.error</code></td>\n<td>错误率 &gt; 1%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"指标体系\">指标体系</h2><p>核心 Prometheus 指标：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>apollo_router_http_requests_total{method, status}</code> — 吞吐</li>\n<li><code>apollo_router_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket</code> — 延迟</li>\n<li><code>apollo_router_subgraph_errors_total{subgraph_name}</code> — 子图错误</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"告警策略\">告警策略</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>P1</td>\n<td>Router 不可达</td>\n<td>立即 oncall</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P2</td>\n<td>单子图错误率 &gt; 10% / 5min</td>\n<td>通知 owner</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P3</td>\n<td>P99 &gt; 1s / 15min</td>\n<td>创建 ticket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P4</td>\n<td>缓存命中率 &lt; 80%</td>\n<td>日报关注</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"日志策略\">日志策略</h2><p>Apollo Router v2.16 引入 header masking——日志中自动屏蔽 Authorization 等敏感 header：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"telemetry:&#10;  instrumentation:&#10;    spans:&#10;      router:&#10;        attributes:&#10;          http.request.header.authorization:&#10;            request_header: authorization&#10;            redact: true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">telemetry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  instrumentation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    spans</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      router</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        attributes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          http.request.header.authorization</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            request_header</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">authorization</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            redact</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>可观测性需覆盖 Router 层 + 子图层 + 网络链路</li>\n<li>OpenTelemetry 是标准化框架，Router 原生支持</li>\n<li>分布式追踪是定位跨子图瓶颈的核心手段</li>\n<li>告警按子图粒度设置，快速定位问题源</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"schema-registry\">Schema Registry 与 CI/CD</a>——可观测性数据反馈到 schema 决策</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../../devops-tools/observability/tracing-and-alerting/distributed-tracing\">分布式追踪原理</a>——OpenTelemetry 体系</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实际告警规则配置示例\">实际告警规则配置示例</h2><p>基于 Prometheus + AlertManager 的完整 Federation 告警配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"groups:&#10;  - name: federation-gateway&#10;    rules:&#10;      - alert: SubgraphHighErrorRate&#10;        expr: |&#10;          sum(rate(apollo_router_subgraph_errors_total[5m])) by (subgraph_name)&#10;          / sum(rate(apollo_router_http_requests_total[5m])) by (subgraph_name) &gt; 0.1&#10;        for: 5m&#10;        labels:&#10;          severity: high&#10;        annotations:&#10;          summary: &#39;子图 {{ $labels.subgraph_name }} 错误率超 10%&#39;&#10;&#10;      - alert: RouterHighLatency&#10;        expr: |&#10;          histogram_quantile(0.99, &#10;            sum(rate(apollo_router_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le)&#10;          ) &gt; 1.0&#10;        for: 15m&#10;        labels:&#10;          severity: medium&#10;        annotations:&#10;          summary: &#39;Router P99 延迟超过 1 秒&#39;&#10;&#10;      - alert: QueryPlanCacheLow&#10;        expr: apollo_router_query_planning_cache_hit_ratio &lt; 0.8&#10;        for: 30m&#10;        labels:&#10;          severity: low&#10;        annotations:&#10;          summary: &#39;查询计划缓存命中率低于 80%&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">groups</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">federation-gateway</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SubgraphHighErrorRate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          sum(rate(apollo_router_subgraph_errors_total[5m])) by (subgraph_name)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          / sum(rate(apollo_router_http_requests_total[5m])) by (subgraph_name) > 0.1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">high</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          summary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'子图 {{ $labels.subgraph_name }} 错误率超 10%'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">RouterHighLatency</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          histogram_quantile(0.99, </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            sum(rate(apollo_router_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          ) > 1.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">15m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">medium</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          summary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Router P99 延迟超过 1 秒'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">QueryPlanCacheLow</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">apollo_router_query_planning_cache_hit_ratio &#x3C; 0.8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">30m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">low</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          summary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'查询计划缓存命中率低于 80%'</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"grafana-仪表盘设计\">Grafana 仪表盘设计</h2><p>推荐的 Federation 监控仪表盘布局：</p>\n<p><strong>Row 1 — 全局概览</strong>：总 QPS、总错误率、Router P99 延迟、活跃连接数</p>\n<p><strong>Row 2 — 子图健康</strong>：按子图分组的错误率热力图、各子图 P99 延迟排行</p>\n<p><strong>Row 3 — 查询规划</strong>：查询计划缓存命中率、规划耗时分布、未命中的 Top-N 查询</p>\n<p><strong>Row 4 — 资源使用</strong>：Router CPU/内存、子图连接池使用率、Redis 缓存命中率</p>\n<p>关键设计原则：首先展示&quot;有没有问题&quot;（Row 1），然后定位&quot;哪里有问题&quot;（Row 2），最后提供&quot;为什么有问题&quot;（Row 3-4）。</p>\n<p>每个面板都应配置合理的时间范围默认值（5min 精度用于实时监控，1h 用于趋势分析）并设置对应的告警阈值链接。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"网关可观测性：追踪、指标与告警","id":"网关可观测性-追踪-指标与告警"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Apollo Router 遥测配置","id":"apollo-router-遥测配置"},{"level":2,"text":"分布式追踪结构","id":"分布式追踪结构"},{"level":2,"text":"指标体系","id":"指标体系"},{"level":2,"text":"告警策略","id":"告警策略"},{"level":2,"text":"日志策略","id":"日志策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"实际告警规则配置示例","id":"实际告警规则配置示例"},{"level":2,"text":"Grafana 仪表盘设计","id":"grafana-仪表盘设计"}],"prev":{"title":"Schema Registry 与 CI/CD 集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/graphql-federation/operations/schema-registry"},"next":{"title":"生产部署与性能调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/graphql-federation/operations/deployment-performance"}}